spec:
  id: cognitive_metrics
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: highest
  module: Cognition
  compiler_stage: Cognitive Evaluation
  description: >
purpose[6]: Measure,evaluate,benchmark,compare,optimize,engineering cognition.
philosophy[6]: Good engineering,is measurable.,Better reasoning,produces better metrics.,Metrics guide,continuous improvement.
pipeline[11]: Cognitive Process,→,Signal Collection,→,Metric Calculation,→,Evaluation,→,Feedback,→,Improvement
categories[8]: Reasoning,Learning,Memory,Decision,Reflection,Prediction,Debugging,Architecture
reasoning[7]: Reasoning Depth,Branch Count,Evidence Coverage,Assumption Count,Contradiction Detection,Reasoning Consistency,Proof Completeness
learning[6]: Learning Rate,Knowledge Retention,Transfer Score,Generalization Score,Specialization Score,Capability Growth
memory[6]: Recall Accuracy,Retrieval Speed,Reinforcement Rate,Consolidation Rate,Memory Density,Knowledge Reuse
decision[6]: Decision Accuracy,Decision Confidence,Decision Stability,Reversal Rate,Tradeoff Quality,Alternative Coverage
reflection[5]: Lesson Quality,Reflection Depth,Memory Updates,Improvement Rate,Repeated Mistakes
prediction[4]: Prediction Accuracy,Calibration Error,Forecast Reliability,Confidence Calibration
debugging[5]: Root Cause Accuracy,Time To Root Cause,Fix Success Rate,Regression Rate,False Diagnosis Rate
architecture[5]: Tradeoff Quality,Scalability Score,Maintainability Score,Simplicity Score,Modularity Score
global[6]: Cognitive Efficiency,Knowledge Density,Engineering Maturity,Adaptability,Explainability,Robustness
scoring[5]: Numeric,Weighted,Percentile,Normalized,Relative
aggregation[6]: Mean,Median,Maximum,Minimum,Weighted Average,Bayesian Aggregation
benchmarks[5]: Historical Performance,Organization Standard,Industry Standard,Personal Best,Expert Baseline
signals[6]: Strong Evidence,Weak Evidence,Missing Reasoning,High Confidence,Low Confidence,Contradiction
failures[6]: Hallucination,Overconfidence,Shallow Reasoning,Missing Tradeoff,Missing Validation,Missing Reflection
improvement[5]: Reinforce Strengths,Correct Weaknesses,Update Mental Models,Improve Memory,Improve Decision Quality
ekr:
  description: Every Engineering Knowledge Record
  records[5]: Reasoning Metrics,Learning Metrics,Decision Metrics,Reflection Metrics,Overall Cognitive Score
validation[8]: Every metric,is measurable.,Every score,is reproducible.,Every benchmark,is documented.,Every improvement,is evidence-based.
examples:
  Example_01:
    Task: Debug Memory Leak
    Metrics[3]: Root Cause Accuracy,Time To Root Cause,Reflection Depth
  Example_02:
    Task: Design Cache Layer
    Metrics[3]: Tradeoff Quality,Architecture Score,Decision Confidence
  Example_03:
    Task: Optimize Compiler
    Metrics[3]: Prediction Accuracy,Performance Gain,Learning Transfer
  Example_04:
    Task: Production Incident
    Metrics[3]: Recovery Time,Root Cause Accuracy,Memory Reinforcement
success[5]: Engineering cognition,"becomes measurable,","explainable,",benchmarkable,and continuously improving.
guarantees[5]: Quantifiable Cognition,Continuous Evaluation,Explainable Metrics,Reproducible Measurement,Capability Tracking
future:
  autonomous_metric_generation: true
  adaptive_benchmarking: true
  graph_based_metrics: true
  organization_specific_metrics: true
  lifelong_capability_tracking: true
